{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801660/extras/bb522071f35ddf44f15c096f5744aa5f.poster.avif?t=1760264421\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801660/extras/bb522071f35ddf44f15c096f5744aa5f.webm?t=1760264421\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801660/extras/bb522071f35ddf44f15c096f5744aa5f.mp4?t=1760264421\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Introduction</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Descent is a first-person survival horror game in which you play as an employee of a highly confidential organization that specializes in research and extraction of rare minerals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An unexpected incident occurs at a research station and an evacuation alarm is triggered. As you run for the nearest exit, the ceiling collapses and everything goes dark. You wake up exhausted, drenched in blood and without a single living soul nearby.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In order to escape the facility, you will first need to touch the gates of hell buried deep underneath...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801660/extras/7d15ba00f927cac493c2829f9733ffc3.poster.avif?t=1760264421\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801660/extras/7d15ba00f927cac493c2829f9733ffc3.webm?t=1760264421\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801660/extras/7d15ba00f927cac493c2829f9733ffc3.mp4?t=1760264421\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Research Facility</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden deep within Oregon\u2019s dense forests, far from any signs of human civilization, it\u2019s the perfect place for conducting unethical research...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What lurks in the depths...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The horrors you will stumble upon have been resting for a long time. To overcome them, be smart, gather resources, keep moving, and listen to your surroundings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801660/extras/47a8ded0181a2fa2e72872a4e96a0775.poster.avif?t=1760264421\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801660/extras/47a8ded0181a2fa2e72872a4e96a0775.webm?t=1760264421\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801660/extras/47a8ded0181a2fa2e72872a4e96a0775.mp4?t=1760264421\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro Style 90s Horror Filter</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the dark and twisted story of the research station through notes left behind</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Look for healing items to restore your health</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new paths or interact with the environment using collected items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outrun the enemies: you can't fight back - use the environment to escape or hide from approaching death</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievemen