You wake up exhausted, drenched in blood and without a single living soul nearby.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In order to escape the facility, you will first need to touch the gates of hell buried deep underneath...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801660/extras/7d15ba00f927cac493c2829f9733ffc3.poster.avif?t=1760264421\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801660/extras/7d15ba00f927cac493c2829f9733ffc3.webm?t=1760264421\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801660/extras/7d15ba00f927cac493c2829f9733ffc3.mp4?t=1760264421\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Research Facility</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden deep within Oregon\u2019s dense forests, far from any signs of human civilization, it\u2019s the perfect place for conducting unethical research...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What lurks in the depths...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The horrors you will stumble upon have been resting for a long time. To overcome them, be smart, gather resources, keep moving, and listen to your surroundings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801660/extras/47a8ded0181a2fa2e72872a4e96a0775.poster.avif?t=1760264421\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801660/extras/47a8ded0181a2fa2e72872a4e96a0775.webm?t=1760264421\" ty